":{"identifier":"radia-s53-n1013-where-is-my-horse","mediatype":"audio","collection":["radiafm","radiostationarchives","radioprograms"],"creator":"Soundart Radio","date":"2024-05-09","description":"Let’s bring some new questions to our radio making<br /><br />Where do we live? Where is my horse? Where comes the air from? How to build healthy relationships? Wie viele Leute kennst du hier? Is there a silent place here? Warum? Warum gerade jetzt? Why am I here? Welche Eissorte? Warum? When is it 17 o‘ clock? Where is my horse? What do I hear? Where do you live? What sound do you like to hear when falling asleep? <br /><br />Perhaps we won’t find all the answers this time, but there is always next year, by the lake.<br /><br />Produced in the ‘long form sound installation’ workshop at Radiocamp, Bodensee, Mai 2024 by Insa Trölenberg, Lukas Zittlan, Lukas Lammer, Alexander Schab, Laszlo Ivanovic, Normann Schuh, Anna Claus, Gerald Wang, Kika Demange, Lisa Humsickes, Roman Kalex, Mo Borghorst, Celik Armet, Susann Tonne, Saskia Ackermann, with Lucinda Guy and Alice Armstrong.","language":"eng","licenseurl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.7.0","subject":"radio art;radia","title":"radia-s53-n1013-where-is-my-horse","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","collection_added":["radiostationarchives","radioprograms"],"publicdate":"2024-08-23 21:39:28","addeddate":"2024-08-23 21:39:28"},"server":"ia600800.us.archive.org","uniq":376944994,"workable_servers":["ia600800.us.archive.org","ia800800.us.archive.org"]}